        "whenToUse": "Use in formal, academic, legal, corporate, or institutional contexts when referring to the widespread spreading or broadcasting of knowledge, policies, research data, news alerts, or regulatory bulletins (e.g., 'information dissemination', 'dissemination of results', 'dissemination strategy')."
