        "whenNotToUse": "Do not use 'exhibit' to refer to a simple personal desktop item, casual office handout, or standard slide deck presentation (use 'presentation', 'handout', or 'brochure'). Avoid confusing with 'exhibition' (the overall event or gallery show is the 'exhibition', while the individual display unit or artifact within it is the 'exhibit').",
