        "coreConcept": "An individual who attends an event, meeting, election, or diplomatic proceeding to witness, monitor, and record developments impartially without active participation or voting privileges; or an expert analyst/commentator who closely tracks and assesses industry, market, or political trends for public or media reporting.",
