        "mentalImage": "A tiered clear acrylic literature stand on a modern clinic reception counter, neatly displaying tri-folded glossy paper pamphlets illustrated with infographics on wellness and preventative care.",
        "whenNotToUse": "Do not use for a bound volume with a spine and hardcover (use 'handbook', 'manual', or 'book'). Do not use for a single unfolded advertising handout (use 'flyer' or 'handbill'). Note also that unlike in French or Spanish where 'panfleto' often carries a derogatory political connotation, the English word 'pamphlet' is completely neutral and standard in corporate contexts.",
