        "coreConcept": "A memorable, concise, and persuasive motto or phrase used in advertising, commercial branding, or political campaigning to encapsulate the core value proposition of a product, company, or cause and embed it in public consciousness.",
        "emotionalTone": "Persuasive, inspiring, punchy, memorable, and brand-defining.",
        "formalityLevel": "neutral",
