        "commonMistakes": "Learners sometimes pronounce the 'c' in 'social' as /s/ instead of the postalveolar fricative /\u0283/ ('SOH-shuhl', not 'SOH-see-uhl'). Additionally, ensure 'media' has three clean syllables: MEE-dee-uh.",
