        "connotation": "neutral",
        "coreConcept": "The formal act of presenting, transmitting, or lodging a document, proposal, application, tender bid, or creative work to an authority, committee, or evaluative body for review, appraisal, or approval; ALSO, the document, application, or material itself that has been submitted.",
        "emotionalTone": "Formal, respectful, procedural, and compliance-driven.",
