        "commonMistakes": "Learners frequently mispronounce the initial 'ch' as /t\u0283/ (like in 'chair' or 'cheap') instead of /k/ (as in 'chemistry' or 'chorus'). Some learners also mistakenly place stress on the second syllable (*cha-RAC-ter*).",
        "ipa": "/\u02c8k\u00e6r.\u0259k.t\u025a/",
