        "whenNotToUse": "Do not use \"character\" when you simply mean an entire alphabet or font style (use \"typeface\" or \"font\"); do not confuse with \"letter\" if punctuation or whitespace is included in the measurement; avoid using it as a synonym for general corporate \"reputation\" unless specifically using the phrase \"character reference\" in HR.",
