        "commonMistakes": "Learners often confuse a publishing 'credit line' (acknowledgment of a photographer, illustrator, or image copyright holder) with a 'byline' (which names the author/reporter of an article) or mistakenly equate it exclusively with the banking term 'line of credit' (a borrowing facility).",
        "ipa": "/\u02c8kred.\u026at la\u026an/",
