        "spatialContext": "Printed magazines, newspapers, corporate annual reports, digital news websites directly below hero images, marketing brochure margins, and slide presentation footnotes.",
        "temporalContext": "Inserted during page layout design, verified during editorial proofreading cycles, and cataloged into content management system (CMS) metadata prior to publication."
